  "id": "pixal3d-single",
  "name": "3D asset \u00b7 Pixal3D single image (12 GB)",
  "media": "model",
  "description": "One front-view picture straight to a textured GLB, no turnaround sheet. The back and sides are guessed by the model (tested on a boot: plausible from every angle). RTX 3060 12 GB: about 10 min at 1024, longer at 1536. Raw mesh is about 700k triangles with dark faceted shading; clean up before game use. Comes after the Turnaround sheet artist, which hands over its front view.",
